  "bio": "Ryan Lucas, a renowned tattoo artist based in Colchester, United Kingdom, specializes in neotraditional, illustrative, and black & gray styles. He is known for his exceptional professionalism; from the first point of contact to the final touch of ink, Ryan ensures a meticulously clean and hygienic environment at Cosmic Tattoo UK, fostering a sense of trust and confidence in his clients. His dedication to cleanliness is supported by partnerships with top-notch suppliers like Starr Tattoo Supplies and Butterluxe UK.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Colchester, England, United Kingdom",
